LOCUS       RSF_ori                  563 bp    DNA              UNK 01-JAN-1980
DEFINITION  The RSF1030 (ColE1-family) origin of replication: the 563 bp region
            from the RNA II promoter -35 to the RNA-to-DNA transition, with the
            RNA I / RNA II antisense pair that sets copy number; compatible with
            ColE1/pMB1 and p15A origins..
